    <briefdescription>
<para>Stubs builder emits non-position-independent Arm stubs for pre-v7 CPUs. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>These architectures have no MovT/MovW instructions and don&apos;t support Thumb2. BL is the only Thumb instruction that can generate stubs and they can always be transformed into BLX. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
